Package: spconform
Type: Package
Title: Conformal Prediction for Spatially and Spatio-Temporally Dependent Data
Version: 0.2.2
Date: 2026-10-19
Authors@R: person(given = "Ahmed Sattar", family = "Jabbar",
                   email = "ahmed.state.me@gmail.com", 
                   role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4614-735X"))
Author: Ahmed Sattar Jabbar [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4614-735X>)
Maintainer: Ahmed Sattar Jabbar <ahmed.state.me@gmail.com>
Description: Provides distribution-free, model-agnostic prediction
    intervals and sets for spatially and spatio-temporally dependent data
    using localized conformal calibration. Implements locally weighted
    conformal prediction for geostatistical regression, areal lattices,
    binary/multiclass classification (adaptive prediction sets), discrete
    count/epidemiological responses with overdispersion scaling, and
    multivariate vector outputs via localized Mahalanobis ellipsoids.
    Relaxes the exchangeability assumption under spatial proximity,
    following Mao, Martin and Reich (2024) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2022.2147531>.
    Includes an extensive spatial diagnostic test suite: Moran's I,
    Cliff-Ord Geary's C, Anselin's Local Moran (LISA), directional
    anisotropy ANOVA tests, and spatial conditional coverage tests.
